    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a post-apocalyptic survivor searching for other survivors in the endless desert, but, as the desert is filled with hostile mutated ancient creatures and an extremely harsh environment, it is up to you to assemble your own apocalyptic mech and pilot it to its destination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use quantum technology to transform the volume and mass of any unit to assist in combat or decryption.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/c0f736f2bd19e7ad088b728b549b6ccb.poster.avif?t=1753516280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/c0f736f2bd19e7ad088b728b549b6ccb.webm?t=1753516280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/c0f736f2bd19e7ad088b728b549b6ccb.mp4?t=1753516280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the meat grinder to cut units up close and recycle resources.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/0744a73920cf8417753d0e27bd58940f.poster.avif?t=1753516280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/0744a73920cf8417753d0e27bd58940f.webm?t=1753516280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can assemble your own mech as many times as you want using different components.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/5504b79466669df1ef7cfa4dc2a47de5.poster.avif?t=1753516280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/5504b79466669df1ef7cfa4dc2a47de5.webm?t=1753516280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/5504b79466669df1ef7cfa4dc2a47de5.mp4?t=1753516280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a post-apocalyptic survivor searching for other survivors in the endless desert, but, as the desert is filled with hostile mutated ancient creatures and an extremely harsh environment, it is up to you to assemble your own apocalyptic mech and pilot it to its destination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use quantum technology to transform the volume and mass of any unit to assist in combat or decryption.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/c0f736f2bd19e7ad088b728b549b6ccb.poster.avif?t=1753516280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/c0f736f2bd19e7ad088b728b549b6ccb.webm?t=1753516280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/c0f736f2bd19e7ad088b728b549b6ccb.mp4?t=1753516280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the meat grinder to cut units up close and recycle resources.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/0744a73920cf8417753d0e27bd58940f.poster.avif?t=1753516280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/0744a73920cf8417753d0e27bd58940f.webm?t=1753516280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can assemble your own mech as many times as you want using different components.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/5504b79466669df1ef7cfa4dc2a47de5.poster.avif?t=1753516280\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/5504b79466669df1ef7cfa4dc2a47de5.webm?t=1753516280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489250/extras/5504b79466669df1ef7cfa4dc2a47de5.mp4?t=1753516280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "[Meatgrinder] is a mech-themed shooter where you pilot and assemble your own mech to battle mutated ancient creatures in a post-apocalyptic desert.",
